DESCRIPTION:We are excited to announce that the application period for the 
 AccoUNTable Supervisor Program 2026 Fall Cohort will open on Wednesday\, S
 ept. 2.\n\nThis system-wide leadership development program is designed to 
 equip supervisors with foundational skills for leading people\, building e
 ffective relationships\, and strengthening team performance\, engagement a
 nd retention. The program serves leaders across various stages of their le
 adership journey\, with a values-based focus to support growth and develop
 ment. \n\nApplications will be accepted Sept. 2 - Sept. 15.\n\nCohort sess
 ions will take place in-person once a week on Thursdays from 9 a.m. - noon
  from Oct. 8 - Nov. 12\, at the UNT System Business Services Center (BSC)\
 , 1112 Dallas Dr.\, Denton\, TX 76205\, Room 4202 A/B.\n\nPlease note: Man
 agers must receive approval from their supervisor to participate in the pr
 ogram.\n\nTo learn more about the program and apply for enrollment\, pleas
 e visit the program website and select the “AccoUNTable Supervisor Progr
 am (ASP)”.
