DESCRIPTION:Badminton Tournaments\nEntry Fee: FREE\nOffered: Fall\, Spring\
 , and Summer Semesters\n\nJoin us for a fun and competitive badminton tour
 nament held each semester! These free events are open to all students and 
 offer an exciting opportunity to showcase your skills and compete for camp
 us bragging rights.\n\nTournament Format:\nTournament structure will be de
 termined based on the number of registered participants:\n\nWith fewer par
 ticipants\, a single-elimination bracket will be used.\n\nWith larger part
 icipation\, pool play will determine seeding for a single-elimination play
 off bracket.\n\n⚠️ Important: Once registration closes\, the tournamen
 t bracket will be finalized and locked. No additional entries will be acce
 pted after that time.\n\nChampion Prize: The tournament winner will receiv
 e the exclusive Intramural Champion T-shirt.\n\nFor questions or assistanc
 e\, please contact:\nBilly Mathew\nIntramural Sports Assistant Director\n
 📧 BillyM@unt.edu\n📞 940-565-2954
